From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:21:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] notifications: Tapping a notification also folds the overview

Plinius: tapping a notification folded only the top panel. With the
overview open, the app the notification activated (with its
xdg-activation token, so it was focused) stayed behind it, small among
the running apps, and the tap looked as if nothing happened. E.g. the
update notification opened Settings on its Updates panel there.

Now the overview folds as well, like for an app started from the notch
search.
---
 src/shell.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/shell.c b/src/shell.c
index bbdc37bd..b3d73b22 100644
--- a/src/shell.c
+++ b/src/shell.c
@@ -951,6 +951,8 @@ on_notification_activated (PhoshShell *self)
   priv = phosh_shell_get_instance_private (self);
 
   phosh_top_panel_fold (PHOSH_TOP_PANEL (priv->top_panel));
+  /* Plinius: the app the notification opens comes to the front, not behind the overview */
+  phosh_home_set_state (PHOSH_HOME (priv->home), PHOSH_HOME_STATE_FOLDED);
 }
 
 
